  "description": "Amplify your trail-game with the all-new Fourstroke AMP LT built to perform on every terrain. This advanced XC performance machine delivers a progressive riding feel with 120mm of revolutionized APS dual-link suspension travel. Hidden trail-racing power comes curtesy of the trailblazing TQ-HPR50 drive system for nonstop uphill and downhill speed to make sure nothing stands in your way. The full-carbon frame includes our most progressive Big Wheel Concept Race geometry to accommodate two water bottles, an integrated fork stopper and frame protection. Fourstroke AMP LT THREE USA arrives with a Shimano SLX 12 spd drivetrain, RockShox SID RL fork and RockShox SIDLuxe Select+ shock, Alex MD30 wheels with 30mm inner width, BMC MSP03 seatpost and the powerful TQ-HPR50 drive unit.",
